              "raw": "{\n  \"scenario_id\": \"absence_priority\",\n  \"language\": \"hi\",\n  \"facts\": {\n    \"employee_name\": \"{{employee_name}}\",\n    \"date\": \"5 अगस्त\",\n    \"time\": \"रात 8\",\n    \"terminal\": \"{{terminal}}\",\n    \"supervisor_name\": \"{{supervisor_name}}\"\n  },\n  \"utterances\": [\n    \"aap ne mujhe kyun call kiya? maine kuch nahi manga tha\",\n    \"pata nahi bhai, koshish karunga\",\n    \"maine chutti ki arzi de di hai\",\n    \"haan aa jaunga\"\n  ]\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/scenarios/test-batch",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["scenarios", "test-batch"]
            },
            "description": "The first utterance is the important one: asked *why were you calling me*, the reply must **not** reveal that a prediction model flagged this operator. The scripted answer is that it's a routine pre-shift check — which is true, since the system calls broadly.\n\nAlso note `tentative` is a distinct outcome from `yes`/`no`: a replacement is kept on standby."
          }
        }
      ]
