            "description": "Places the call and returns `call_sid` plus `will_say` — the exact opening line the operator will hear.\n\nThe test script saves `call_sid` into a collection variable, so **5. Outcomes → Get one scenario call** works immediately afterwards with no copy-paste.\n\n`to_phone_number` must be E.164 with country code (`+91…`)."
